{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21460","headline":"遣行十首 六 · 元稹","name":"遣行十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮欲歌吹乐，暗冲泥水情。\n稻花秋雨气，江石夜滩声。\n犬吠穿篱出，鸥眠起水惊。\n愁君明月夜，独自入山行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}